OL,3,GNEWSAMan killed in two-vehicle crash
OL,4,
OL,5,FA 50-year-old man has died following a
OL,6,Fcollision in Lisburn on Tuesday.
OL,8,FThe crash, reported to police at about
OL,9,F05:45 BST, involved a Citroen van and
OL,10,FMini on the Belfast Road.
OL,12,FThe driver of the Mini, James Bingham,
OL,13,Fwas pronounced dead at the scene.
OL,15,FThe driver of the van, a man in his
OL,16,F40s, required treatment for his
OL,17,Finjuries but they are not believed to
OL,18,Fbe life-threatening.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
